Disable GitHub Copilot features and AI telemetry

Inlines the IExperimentationFilterProvider interface to remove the tas-client
dependency, disables Copilot extension version tracking, forces chat
entitlement to hidden, defaults AI edit telemetry stats to false, and marks
the mermaid-chat-features extension as not included.

